  "label": "Historical Context of Slavery",
  "description": "The meme relies on the historical context of slavery in the United States and other regions, where millions of Africans were forcibly brought to the Americas and enslaved. The visual of shackled feet and the text 'i like my slaves' directly reference this history, which is a foundational part of the racial and social fabric of many countries. Understanding this history is necessary to grasp the full impact of the meme.",
